# Build context for the edge image. The build needs the two scripts, the icons,
# the config, and the credentials file, so everything else is excluded to keep
# the context small. Without this, `podman build .` ships the whole directory,
# including any build artifacts left on disk.
*
!scripts/
!scripts/pg-entrypoint.sh
!scripts/configure_edge_models.sh
!decor/
!decor/edge-logo.png
!decor/edge-favicon.png
!config/
!config/local_postgres.yaml
!.env.edge
